\subsubsection parameters ROS parameters

Reads and maintains the following parameters on the ROS server

- \b "~pid_control_flag" : \b [bool] XY PID Control Flag min: False, default: False, max: True
- \b "~p_gain" : \b [double] p gain min: 0.0, default: 0.01, max: 50.0
- \b "~i_gain" : \b [double] i gain min: 0.0, default: 0.01, max: 20.0
- \b "~d_gain" : \b [double] d gain min: 0.0, default: 0.15, max: 50.0

